Derived from Mercury MC Launcher (M²CL), original author ppm203.
The core has been ported from Qt APIs to C++17, libcurl, zlib, platform security
APIs, nlohmann/json and TinyXML2; the shell uses Flutter 3.19.6.
Modified on 2026-10-31. Offline accounts and offline skin injection are excluded.
This is a distinct experimental project, not a continuation of the M²CL release.
